<title>PHILIPPINES: Philex shares trading suspension lifted.</title>
<headline>Philex shares trading suspension lifted.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The suspension on the trading of shares of Philex Mining Corp was lifted by 11:17 local time (0330 GMT), an hour after its shares were frozen by the exchange pending the release of a disclosure, a Philippine Stock Exchange (PSE) official said on Tuesday.</p>
